  "limitations": [
    "Weekly provider membership snapshots do not establish every daily effective change.",
    "Historical publication times and vintage revisions remain unverified.",
    "Two empty volume/amount fields on the sampled delisting date are preserved.",
    "Empty suspended-list response does not establish absence of suspensions.",
    "No historical price or membership query at/after 2024-01-01; no holdout returns or model scores.",
    "Some start-of-year membership snapshots return stale update dates; compare actual sets with official year-end changes before accepting the baseline.",
